# Language: English first

- **Default / native language is English** for all user-facing UI strings, dialogs, errors, splash text, README, GitHub release notes, and public docs.
- Do **not** add Polish (or other languages) as the primary UI. Other languages may be added later only as optional alternatives (e.g. a language setting), never as the sole/default copy.
- Code comments may stay in English. Prefer English for new comments.
- Product credit and brand names stay as-is (e.g. Sableworks, Mateusz Blumensztajn, PocketBook).
